                    {
                        "sense_id": "ff3830bd-a622-3c6e-a9fc-3653d7d4177a",
                        "entry_id": "20536e5a-269f-3720-a1d7-837b9e31447a",
                        "glosses": [
                            "Alternative letter-case form of Boche."
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "alt-of"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "f876aa74-7a1f-4de3-b259-40cffd686645",
                                "sense_id": "ff3830bd-a622-3c6e-a9fc-3653d7d4177a",
                                "text": "Inside the building was a dead French soldier who, as we figured it out, had accounted for the eight boches before they got him."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "208c5b9e-7ff8-411d-bfa3-adf6a7c1c96f",
                                "sense_id": "ff3830bd-a622-3c6e-a9fc-3653d7d4177a",
                                "text": "But Jacques went right on, talking, talking--about the right flank and the left flank and the boches and the Americans."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "4484daf0-d99d-458b-8a51-55a27a0b3dba",
                                "sense_id": "ff3830bd-a622-3c6e-a9fc-3653d7d4177a",
                                "text": "I tell you he's the stuff that will take 'em over the top and make the boches feel cold in the pit of their fat tumtums when they see him coming."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
                ],
